Third-party model weights: lynceus-yolo26m-realwaste-taco.onnx,
                           lynceus-yolo26s-realwaste-taco.onnx
==============================================================

Optional component: Lynceus runs without these weights (DETECTOR_MODEL_PATH
empty). Overview of all third-party material: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The ONNX weights in this directory are NOT covered by the MIT licence of the
Lynceus repository (LICENSE). They are distributed under the terms below.

1. Ultralytics YOLO26 (AGPL-3.0)
   The weights were fine-tuned from Ultralytics' pretrained YOLO26m and
   exported with Ultralytics, both licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
   License v3.0 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html). The weights are
